comment0.text=\n\ The\ main\ application\ class\ for\ the\ London\ Air\ Pollution\ Viewer.\n\ It\ is\ responsible\ for\ creating\ the\ UI\ and\ loading\ data.\n\n\ @author\ Ayan\ Mamun,\ Raihan\ Islam,\ Abeer\ Hussain,\ Karim\ He\n\ @version\ 1.0\n
